    "body": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0\"></head><body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#09090B;font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#e5e7eb;\"><div style=\"max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;background:#09090B;\"><div style=\"height:4px;background:#C8922A;\"></div><div style=\"background:#0A0B0C;padding:18px 36px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #1f2428;\"><img src=\"https://downrangeco.com/img/logo.png\" alt=\"DownRange\" width=\"160\" height=\"auto\" style=\"display:block;height:auto;max-height:42px;width:auto;max-width:180px;\"></div><div style=\"padding:40px;background:#0d0e10;\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-size:15px;color:#e5e7eb;line-height:1.85;\">Hey {{firstName}},</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-size:15px;color:#e5e7eb;line-height:1.85;\">Sent you a note a couple weeks back about DownRange \u2014 just making sure it didn't get buried.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-size:15px;color:#e5e7eb;line-height:1.85;\">{{channelName}} is still on the site at <a href=\"https://www.downrangeco.com/video\" style=\"color:#C8922A;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;\">downrangeco.com/video</a>. Gun owners find your content there without fighting the algorithm.</p><div style=\"padding:14px 18px;background:#111316;border-left:3px solid #C8922A;margin:20px 0;font-size:14px;color:#d1d5db;line-height:1.75;\">No pressure, no pitch. If you've been meaning to look and haven't had a chance \u2014 totally fine.</div><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-size:15px;color:#e5e7eb;line-height:1.85;\">If you have questions: <a href=\"mailto:dj@downrangeco.com\" style=\"color:#C8922A;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;\">dj@downrangeco.com</a></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-size:15px;color:#e5e7eb;line-height:1.85;\">\u2014 DJ</p></div><div style=\"padding:24px 36px;background:#0A0B0C;border-top:1px solid #1f2428;\"><table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;\"><tr><td style=\"width:56px;vertical-align:top;padding-right:16px;\"><img src=\"https://downrangeco.com/img/dj-avatar.png\" alt=\"DJ Cavalcanti\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" style=\"display:block;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;object-fit:cover;\"></td><td style=\"vertical-align:top;\"><div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:#e5e7eb;\">DJ Cavalcanti</div><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#9ca3af;margin-top:2px;\">Founder, DownRange</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px;font-size:11px;\"><a href=\"https://www.downrangeco.com\" style=\"color:#C8922A;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;\">downrangeco.com</a> &nbsp;&#xB7;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.downrangeco.com/press\" style=\"color:#C8922A;text-decoration:none;\">Press &amp; Partners</a></div></td></tr></table></div><div style=\"padding:12px 36px;background:#09090B;text-align:center;\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:10px;color:#374151;\">You received this because you were added to the DownRange outreach list. &nbsp;<a href=\"{{unsubscribeUrl}}\" style=\"color:#4b5563;text-decoration:none;\">Unsubscribe</a></p></div></div></body></html>"
