  {
    "name": "Manufacturer \u2014 Partnership & Press Coverage",
    "type": "organization",
    "subject": "{{firstName}} \u2014 DownRange editorial coverage for {{businessName}}",
    "previewText": "Independent firearms portal. No manufacturer funding. Editorial merit only.",
    "variables": [
      "{{firstName}}",
      "{{businessName}}",
      "{{portalUrl}}",
      "{{pressUrl}}",
      "{{unsubscribeUrl}}"
    ],
    "body": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0\"></head><body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#09090B;font-family:Helvetica Neue,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#e5e7eb;\"><div style=\"max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;background:#09090B;\"><div style=\"height:4px;background:#C8922A;\"></div><div style=\"background:#0A0B0C;padding:18px 36px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #1f2428;\"><img src=\"https://downrangeco.com/img/logo.png\" alt=\"DownRange\" width=\"160\" height=\"auto\" style=\"display:block;height:auto;max-height:42px;width:auto;max-width:180px;\"></div><div style=\"padding:40px;background:#0d0e10;\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-size:15px;color:#e5e7eb;line-height:1.85;\">Hi {{firstName}},</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-size:15px;color:#e5e7eb;line-height:1.85;\">My name is DJ Cavalcanti. I'm the founder of <a href=\"https://www.downrangeco.com\" style=\"color:#C8922A;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;\">DownRange</a> \u2014 an independent Second Amendment portal built for the firearms community.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-size:15px;color:#e5e7eb;line-height:1.85;\">DownRange is not funded by manufacturers, distributors, or advertisers. Editorial coverage is earned, not bought.</p><div style=\"height:1px;background:#1f2428;margin:24px 0;\"></div><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-size:15px;color:#e5e7eb;line-height:1.85;\">What we cover:</p><ul style=\"margin:0 0 18px;padding-left:22px;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;font-size:14px;color:#d1d5db;line-height:1.75;\">New product launches and manufacturer releases \u2014 tracked across 16+ manufacturer feeds</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;font-size:14px;color:#d1d5db;line-height:1.75;\">Ballistics, specifications, and comparative analysis</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;font-size:14px;color:#d1d5db;line-height:1.75;\">Breaking firearms news across 13+ sources, updated throughout the day</li><li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;font-size:14px;color:#d1d5db;line-height:1.75;\">All 50 states' gun laws, CCW reciprocity, and NFA data</li></ul><div style=\"padding:14px 18px;background:#111316;border-left:3px solid #C8922A;margin:20px 0;font-size:14px;color:#d1d5db;line-height:1.75;\">We track every public announcement and cover the ones that matter to active gun owners, instructors, dealers, and 2A advocates. {{businessName}} belongs in that coverage.</div><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-size:15px;color:#e5e7eb;line-height:1.85;\">If you have new products launching, press releases, or changes to existing lines:</p><div style=\"height:1px;background:#1f2428;margin:24px 0;\"></div><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-size:15px;color:#e5e7eb;line-height:1.85;\"><strong style=\"color:#C8922A;\">One more thing \u2014 and this is the one I most want you to read.</strong></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-size:15px;color:#e5e7eb;line-height:1.85;\">We just launched a <strong>written reviews section</strong> on DownRange. Not a paid placement. Not a send-us-stuff-and-we'll-say-nice-things program. An actual editorial reviews operation where products get put through real-world testing and get honest assessments \u2014 the kind gun owners trust because they know it wasn't bought.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-size:15px;color:#e5e7eb;line-height:1.85;\">We're starting with written reviews and expanding from there. Video reviews are already on the roadmap \u2014 YouTube and wherever else the audience is. The goal is to build the review destination the firearms industry has never had: one where products compete on merit, not marketing spend, and where readers know the person who tested the gun actually shot it.</p><div style=\"padding:14px 18px;background:#111316;border-left:3px solid #C8922A;margin:20px 0;font-size:14px;color:#d1d5db;line-height:1.75;\"><strong>Here's the ask: ship us a product.</strong> If {{businessName}} has something new \u2014 a pistol, a rifle, an optic, an accessory \u2014 send it our way. We'll put real range time into it, run it through its paces the way your customers actually use it, photograph it properly, and publish a thorough, honest review. Our readers are exactly who you want to reach: serious gun owners who research before they buy.</div><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-size:15px;color:#e5e7eb;line-height:1.85;\">We don't charge for reviews. We don't guarantee positive coverage. What we guarantee is that your product gets a fair shot, a real review, and an audience that's actively making purchase decisions when they read it.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-size:15px;color:#e5e7eb;line-height:1.85;\">Getting {{businessName}} into our review queue is simple: just reply to this email. We'll send shipping details and set a timeline. No paperwork needed to start a conversation.</p><div style=\"margin:28px 0 8px;\"><a href=\"https://www.downrangeco.com/reviews\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#C8922A;color:#000;padding:13px 26px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:0.04em;\">See Our Reviews Section &#x2192;</a></div><p style=\"margin:0 0 18px;font-size:15px;color:#e5e7eb;line-height:1.85;\">DJ Cavalcanti</p></div><div style=\"padding:24px 36px;background:#0A0B0C;border-top:1px solid #1f2428;\"><table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;\"><tr><td style=\"width:56px;vertical-align:top;padding-right:16px;\"><img src=\"https://downrangeco.com/img/dj-avatar.png\" alt=\"DJ Cavalcanti\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" style=\"display:block;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;object-fit:cover;\"></td><td style=\"vertical-align:top;\"><div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:#e5e7eb;\">DJ Cavalcanti</div><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#9ca3af;margin-top:2px;\">Founder, DownRange</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px;font-size:11px;\"><a href=\"https://www.downrangeco.com\" style=\"color:#C8922A;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;\">downrangeco.com</a> &nbsp;&#xB7;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.downrangeco.com/press\" style=\"color:#C8922A;text-decoration:none;\">Press &amp; Partners</a></div></td></tr></table></div><div style=\"padding:12px 36px;background:#09090B;text-align:center;\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:10px;color:#374151;\">You received this because you were added to the DownRange outreach list. &nbsp;<a href=\"{{unsubscribeUrl}}\" style=\"color:#4b5563;text-decoration:none;\">Unsubscribe</a></p></div></div></body></html>"
  },
